WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:20.610
On Friday morning Sid agreed to take care of the kitten until after school.

2
00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:24.670
"I just have to get through this cooking show," Ben said.

3
00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.670
"Then I'll find a home for the kitten."

4
00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:30.730
"That's what you said yesterday," Sid complained.

5
00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.410
He pointed to his torn bedsheets. "It destroys everything."

6
00:00:38.090 --> 00:00:41.890
"One more day," Ben promised, hurrying off.

7
00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:51.440
At Monster Academy everyone was outside, waiting eagerly for Kids' Kitchen Showdown to start.

8
00:00:55.194 --> 00:01:04.779
"The master chef has arrived!" a mummy shouted.

9
00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.850
Ben grinned as monsters patted him on the back.

10
00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:11.750
Mr. Freaky's noses were wiggling madly.

11
00:01:12.588 --> 00:01:16.315
Sweat dripped down Mayor Hubbletree's forehead.

12
00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:19.750
Both the mayor and Mr. Freaky reached for their handkerchiefs.

13
00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:24.527
"Please calm down, Mr. Freaky," Miss Bungle said.

14
00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:28.150
"And you too, Mayor. Everything will go smoothly."

15
00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:36.770
"It better," the mayor said, scowling at Mr. Freaky. "This is a big day!"

16
00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.230
A van arrived, followed by some cars.

17
00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:48.350
Ben watched as crew members unloaded cameras, lights, and bundles of cords.

18
00:01:48.945 --> 00:01:53.937
Gaby pointed toward three human kids.

19
00:01:53.938 --> 00:01:57.270
"They must be the other contestants."

20
00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:00.560
Then three adults got out of a limousine.

21
00:02:00.673 --> 00:02:03.839
Mr. Icky walked over to Ben.

22
00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:07.100
"Those are the judges," the teacher said.

23
00:02:10.112 --> 00:02:14.880
"That's Bolton Ramsey. He owns several restaurants.

24
00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.919
And there's Margaret Oh and Rebecca Gold.

25
00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.920
They wrote a wonderful cookbook together."

26
00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:24.380
Bolton Ramsey looked up at the school building.

27
00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:31.730
"Good grief," he muttered. "What is this dark and sinister place?"

28
00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:36.170
"I heard it's where the monsters go to school," Margaret Oh said.

29
00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:38.570
Rebecca Gold said nothing.

30
00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:45.569
"Can I help you carry anything?" an octopus monster asked a crew member.

31
00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:50.930
"I have plenty of arms!" She wiggled her arms wildly.

32
00:02:51.303 --> 00:02:54.433
The crew member's face went pale.

33
00:02:54.433 --> 00:02:56.855
Mayor Hubbletree hurried over.

34
00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:02.030
"It's okay, sir! This, um, creature won't harm you."

35
00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:07.170
He shooed the octopus monster away and turned back to the man.

36
00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:11.910
"Most monsters are actually quite friendly once you get to know them."

37
00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:16.450
"We've only had a few monsters on the show," the man murmured.

38
00:03:20.398 --> 00:03:25.517
"Mayor Hubbletree." A woman approached and shook the mayor's hand.

39
00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:29.930
"I'm Viv Stryder, the host of Kids' Kitchen Showdown."

40
00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:33.390
She looked around at the monsters.

41
00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:37.740
"Are you sure this place is safe?"

42
00:03:38.414 --> 00:03:41.948
"Absolutely!" Mayor Hubbletree said.

43
00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:45.020
"Nothing will go wrong. I promise!"

44
00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:47.980
The host narrowed her eyes.

45
00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:54.120
"I wanted to film this episode at the People Place Middle School, but you convinced me to do it here.

46
00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:57.700
If anything goes wrong, it'll be your fault."

47
00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:04.750
Mayor Hubbletree wiped more sweat from his forehead as everyone headed inside.

48
00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:09.370
The cooking classroom still smelled like hot sauce.

49
00:04:10.873 --> 00:04:15.067
Ben and Waldo glanced at each other.

50
00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:19.209
"It smells weird in here," Viv Stryder said.

51
00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:24.370
"Oh well, let's just get this day over with. Start setting up, folks!"

52
00:04:24.890 --> 00:04:28.090
Crew members got to work setting up lights and cameras.

53
00:04:29.170 --> 00:04:32.870
"That wall is shaking!" Margaret Oh said.

54
00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:39.927
"Yes," Mr. Freaky said. "I don't know what—"

55
00:04:39.928 --> 00:04:43.941
"It's nothing!" Mayor Hubbletree interrupted the principal.

56
00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:50.730
"That's just what the walls in a monster school do." He laughed nervously.

57
00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:53.469
Ben leaned closer to Waldo.

58
00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:56.590
"We obviously didn't clean up all of the hot sauce.

59
00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:59.970
Do you think that's what is causing the wall to shake?"

60
00:05:00.048 --> 00:05:05.081
Waldo shrugged. "Maybe."

61
00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.550
Bright light flooded the room.

62
00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.430
Cameras rolled.

63
00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:17.560
Ben was so nervous, he barely heard Viv Stryder introduce all the contestants.

64
00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.969
The host was still speaking to one of the cameras.

65
00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:29.430
"The first dish for today will be mac and cheese. Time starts . . . now!"

66
00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:33.190
Ben hurried into the pantry for ingredients.

67
00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:40.656
"Eww!" one human kid said. "They have canned slugs here!"

68
00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:43.970
"And worm eyes!" said another kid.

69
00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.530
Ben returned to his workspace.

70
00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.950
He put bat claws, leeches, and mud into a food processor.

71
00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:06.260
Then he shredded some moldy cheese.

72
00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:12.000
Once his macaroni was boiled, Ben put everything into a pan.

73
00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:14.040
He slid it into the oven.

74
00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:19.819
He noticed the wall was shaking even more now.

75
00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:25.320
"What is going on with that wall?" Bolton Ramsey said.

76
00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:27.480
"Is there something alive in there?"

77
00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.280
Ben hoped nothing bad was going to happen.

78
00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:36.520
But if something bad was going to happen, he really hoped it wasn't because of the hot sauce.

79
00:06:39.597 --> 00:06:43.548
"Time's up!" Viv Stryder called a little while later.

80
00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:47.110
"Ben will present his dish to the judges first."

81
00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:49.710
Ben took a deep breath.

82
00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:55.810
Then he picked up his mac and cheese and floated up to the judges' table.

83
00:06:56.386 --> 00:07:01.304
"You're a g-ghost!" Margaret Oh said.

84
00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:02.900
Ben grinned.

85
00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.239
"Right then," Bolton Ramsey said.

86
00:07:06.240 --> 00:07:13.420
"Let's see your mac and—" The chef stopped talking as Ben placed the pan on the table.

87
00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:16.920
"Good grief!" Bolton Ramsey cried.

88
00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:19.440
"What's sticking out of the food?"

89
00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:24.280
"It's just some dried lizard tails," Ben said. "For crunch."

90
00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:28.800
"For crunch?" Bolton Ramsey shook his head.

91
00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.900
"I'm not eating any of this monster's food!"
